gures back (0.8785, 1.0×3, +0.05/0.36/+0.3908, 19/24, 8/8). Structurally, the raw record's headers ARE §E.A/§E.B/§E.C — the design's own measurement sections — and it asserts no H1/H2 verdict and no success criterion of its own, so there is no place in it where a non-pre-registered standard could be doing hidden work. Internal arithmetic self-checks pass where inputs are printed: 1−0.8767=0.1233; 0.90−0.41=0.49; 0.55−0.16=0.39; both sign-test p-values are exactly the pre-registered two-sided form (2/2^24, 2/2^8).\n\n## Honesty disclosures (certainty: evidence-based)\n- **NOT TESTED:** findings.json NOT read, so the record's 'every number below is transcribed from that file' and 'reconciliation flags all true' claims are unverified by me. This audit establishes that each reported number corresponds to a PRE-REGISTERED MEASUREMENT, not that it is correct.\n- **NOT TESTED:** analyze.py NOT read, so OC-1's '11' could not be mapped to actual check names.\n- **NOT TESTED:** frozen comparator figures not re-derived against experiment6 (out of scope); audited only as carried quotes, and §A's triple matches DESIGN's.\n- **NOT TESTED:** per-pair deltas, quantiles, margins, per-class medians NOT recomputed from their 24 underlying values — only cross-checked where the record prints the inputs.\n- **NOT DONE (by instruction):** H1/H2 not assessed; no follow-ups designed; no other stage7/ file read.","created_at":"2026-10-02T21:08:06.787791854Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:CtCzijQnAOXXuAC2Z896ztifR2BUmFukKw2GZTEQXIU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBidje3lVXDH/HZZrFGLJqqLw/65HDuhyRa10Xhbq0LgAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABASAZd1zsn8xGJayVqhlZKyxoSFZbb+6qKShzETS4jtakGV224PB0d41yywl+lcLxSeHEVJVMdvY/EiceOjMoEBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:CtCzijQnAOXXuAC2Z896ztifR2BUmFukKw2GZTEQXIU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBidje3lVXDH/HZZrFGLJqqLw/65HDuhyRa10Xhbq0LgAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAA